th.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T07:18:11-07:00","id":192382,"title":"","content":"Off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> Mnemon, V'neef Cathak Cainan and Ragara Banoba have art in MoEP: Dragon-Blooded.<br /> I think the Cynis sisters are depicted somewhere.<br /> Tepet, Nellens and Sesus aren't given identifiable leadership figures.<br /> The married couple who leads Peleps has afaik not been depicted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T09:59:02-07:00","id":192491,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Have any page references? I'm looking for Lady V'neef in particular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T10:14:29-07:00","id":192498,"title":"","content":"Considering she's supposed to be Miss Diplomacy, I assume she's the lady with a Wood mon on her belt who is making Mnemon laugh in that party scene in the middle of the House V'neef description.<br /> <br /> Though that picture has zero visible Breeding marks, which goes pretty strongly against the written description.<br /> <br /> And the memetically sexy Cathak Cainan can be found pretty easily with a simple Google search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T10:17:27-07:00","id":192500,"title":"","content":"Page 85 Exalted: the Dragon-Blooded and Page 49 Manual of Exalted Power Dragon-Blooded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T01:09:15-07:00","id":193273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=192382#post192382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> Mnemon, V'neef, Cathak Cainan and Ragara Banoba have art in MoEP: Dragon-Blooded.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to mention his lover, Ragara Soras Heral. There's another image, with just the two of them too in MoEP: DB, pg.43.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=192382#post192382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the Cynis sisters are depicted somewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>THAT</b> i would like to see. Or will repent forever from asking for, it's 50/50 right now, i guess.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=192382#post192382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tepet, Nellens and Sesus aren't given identifiable leadership figures.</div> </div> </div> </div>In Nellens case i'll agree little is actually said (though as a senator and at about 61 years old Nellens Poramo might count), but we do get some information on Tepet and Sesus leaders, they are least are mentioned, we never got any art on them or somesuch.<br /> <br /> What is actually a shame as some of them do sound pretty colorful in the MoEP. Sesus Alon for example, because &quot;powerful Senator in the Deliberative&quot;, &quot;rigorous ethics&quot; and &quot;fire aspect&quot; is an unexpected mix for a Sesus with everything to be explosive, specially in a house leader. Or Sesus Magel, a widowed lady that, while not head of the household or a member of the Deliberative anymore, is apparently still very much a politician, while the official head of the household, Sesus Magel Talor also a widowed politician, is thoroughly and happily in the pocket of the Guild and entertained with his secret peasant lover. Also, is his recently killed dragonlord of the Sesus legions wife really dead or in the paws of some pretty scary foreign powers? Not to mention the notoriously awful, brutal and sadistic animal that is Sesus Chenow, who doesn't even officially lead anymore, and how much of utter bastard must Cathak Catis be to have actually married his daughter and sucessor, not to mention the parents of also notorious bastard Sesus Lahor. Besides, it's worth pointing out that Sesus Ossissa, now a scandalously notorious outcste pirate, is mentioned as past sworn brother of Chenow and household founders along with him. And then there are the Denerid's, whose point seems to be not only decadent like the Cynis but utterly outrageously scandalous at it, if their \u201clegion\u201d of slave concubines is any indication.<br /> <br /> Things are worse in the Tepets case, as the little we know about Jita, Jyuko, Marek, Mokairo and Vergus is that they are the 5 dragon-blooded children of consort Tepet that joined resources in making their own house (what in itself points out to their being not exactly very powerful on their own back then) and tended to be quite quarelsome before the Bull of the North debacle. They are little more than interchangeable elder names and what i just pulled from the MoEP is probably <b>more</b> than anybody actually remembers about any of them, myself included, most of time.<br /> <br /> Arada is probably the closest to Tepet leadership we ever get to see in the books (and has a pretty badass mugshot beside Kejak in page 33 of the corebook, i think), as he's pretty near the top and basically as far one can get while actively fighting <b>not</b> to be... Seriously, he got Tepet's personal daiklave just to make one of the house patriarch's shut up about someone in the &quot;younger generation&quot; proving itself worthy of its heritage/legacy. <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=192382#post192382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The married couple who leads Peleps has afaik not been depicted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, Peleps Febaris and her husband, Peleps Taxin - we know they are both major figures in the Deliberative and utter bastards in raising children, but beside that, anything goes.<br /> <br /> As an aside don't forget Ledaal, everybody seems to forget Ledaal. <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Poor guys, it's almost like they are more Sidereal front than DB House. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> What's pretty curious considering that we are given at least one paragraph in each of the four leaders described and one of them is Ledaal Caros, Ledaal Kes' supposedly equally, if not even more notorious <b>father</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-10-2014, 06:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T09:41:05-07:00","id":200100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=193273#post193273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>THAT</b> i would like to see. Or will repent forever from asking for, it's 50/50 right now, i guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would seem I was mistaken. Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T19:17:45-07:00","id":200653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=200100#post200100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would seem I was mistaken. Sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div>No prob, it happens and truth be told i wanted to be the one mistaken in that case, for good or for ill. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But still on the Cynis sisters, while, afaik, never outright saying it like with Banoba, the fluff on Bhagwei seems to imply he's older than them too.<br /> <br /> He's also older than Mnemon, but possibly by a very small margin, anything between 1-2 years to 2-3 decades at most (though i'm admitedly guessing based in Aspectbook Wood fluff). Going by these details one might conclude they somewhere between them or a little younger in age and most possibly apparent age. And yes, i know this is a bunch of wild guessing considering they both their centuries of sybaritic lifestyle and massive resources to obtain anagathics &amp; stuff could considerably affect how well they weathered or not the ages. Their apparent age could be anything from 29 to 92. :P<br /> <br /> On an aside, am i the only male that occasionally imagines them as triplets even though it's pretty improbable with DBs fertility and purity issues?<br /> <br /> Speaking of DB pictures and ages, for some reason i find it funny that House matron V'neef is about the same age as young senator Nellens Poramo and so you could easily place her in Cyan's place as paramour in most of the comics involving both. Nonsense i know, but i'm weird like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T06:20:29-07:00","id":201043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/192349-pictures-of-the-dragonblooded-great-house-leaders?p=200653#post200653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No prob, it happens and truth be told i wanted to be the one mistaken in that case, for good or for ill. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But still on the Cynis sisters, while, afaik, never outright saying it like with Banoba, the fluff on Bhagwei seems to imply he's older than them too.<br /> <br /> He's also older than Mnemon, but possibly by a very small margin, anything between 1-2 years to 2-3 decades at most (though i'm admitedly guessing based in Aspectbook Wood fluff). Going by these details one might conclude they somewhere between them or a little younger in age and most possibly apparent age. And yes, i know this is a bunch of wild guessing considering they both their centuries of sybaritic lifestyle and massive resources to obtain anagathics &amp; stuff could considerably affect how well they weathered or not the ages. Their apparent age could be anything from 29 to 92. :P<br /> <br /> On an aside, am i the only male that occasionally imagines them as triplets even though it's pretty improbable with DBs fertility and purity issues?<br /> <br /> Speaking of DB pictures and ages, for some reason i find it funny that House matron V'neef is about the same age as young senator Nellens Poramo and so you could easily place her in Cyan's place as paramour in most of the comics involving both. Nonsense i know, but i'm weird like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Wisel, Falen and Balar are triplets in our game. Our House Cynis is also famous for twins and triplets historically, with the lesser known fact that the Fire-aspected Cynis don't seem to carry the multiple-children trait being a small plot point for a few characters in our game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1564-shinjo","name":"Shinjo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}